# MALDA OSS — always apply

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture.md` before large changes.
- Never run the full test suite unless the user explicitly asks. Use filtered `dotnet test`.
- Do not hand-edit `GeneratedProgram.cs` or generated `.js` from `.malda`; change sources and regenerate.
- Use `function` in examples and docs (`fn`/`def` are syntax errors).
- Prompt declarations: name-only parameters (no typed prompt params).
- Desktop IDE = reference; Web IDE = browser playground (not feature parity).
- Product apps and vertical domain packs are out of scope for this repository.
- `docs/planning/` is historical; verify against code and `ReferenceManual/`.
